  "description": "The DK Phase frame is the weapon of choice for the DK freestyle squad. With stable, all-around geometry, the Phase is as much at home 15 feet in the air as it is on a two-foot-high ledge.\n\nIt’s a great looking frame, but you can’t see some of the key features from the outside. It all starts with 100% high-quality Japanese butted, tapered, and heat-treated 4130 chromoly tubing. A unique offset inner “Eclipse” down tube wall that’s thin up top and thick on the bottom saves weight while maintaining strength. With the Phase, we created the perfect balance of responsiveness, stability and bike control, combined with tried and true materials in one do-it-all frame.\n\nTop Tube Length 20.6”, 20.8”, or 21”\n\nChain Stay Length 13.25”\n\nHead Tube Angle 75.2º\n\nSeat Tube Angle 71º\n\nBB Height +1.25” above axle line\n\nBB Drop -1.25” (-32mm)\n\nBB Type Mid\n\nWeight 4 lbs 8 oz (+1.6 oz for all hardware)",
